  "body_html": "<p>Discover the beauty and symbolism of our Tree of Life Quilt Set, a perfect blend of meaningful design and cozy comfort. This personalized quilt features the iconic Yggdrasil, symbolizing resilience and interconnectedness, making it an ideal gift for loved ones or a cherished addition to your own home.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Design:</strong> Features the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life, representing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Functional as a bedding set, a cozy wrap for reading, or a decorative accent on your sofa, suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent present for men, women, moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandmas, grandpas, wives, husbands, sons, daughters, and all other beloved ones for any special occasion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with 1 Quilt, with an optional pillowcase available.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt with text input to make it uniquely yours.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Colorful Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Minimalist</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
